+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -22,6 +22,11 @@ All notable changes to meowcaller, tracked per module. Format loosely follows
   they are a guest (`account_kind=guest`): a guest has no phone number, so
   the name is all a client can show.
 - Joining a link whose call is already held here is refused.
+- A link joined second is told to create the group key in its join ACK
+  (`rekey="1"` on `group_info`) and no later `group_update` repeats it; only
+  the stanza handler fanned the key out, so nobody sent it and media never
+  started. The join now fans the key out when its ACK asks for it
+  (`engine_call_link_test.go`).
 - KAT-verified on the captured stanzas (`signaling/call_link_test.go`,
   `engine_call_link_test.go`); not yet validated on a live call.
 
